<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (UN Women is the United Nations entity dedicated to advancing gender equality and the empowerment of women and girls worldwide. Established to champion the rights of women and girls in every sphere of society, UN Women works closely with Member States, civil society organizations, international partners, and local communities to develop policies and initiatives that promote equal rights, expand opportunities, and ensure protection from discrimination, violence, and injustice. By advocating for inclusive governance, economic empowerment, education, healthcare, and leadership opportunities, UN Women seeks to create a world where every woman and girl can realize her full potential, regardless of her background or circumstances.)
/E (UN Women is the United Nations entity dedicated to advancing gender equality and the empowerment of women and girls worldwide. Established to champion the rights of women and girls in every sphere of society, UN Women works closely with Member States, civil society organizations, international partners, and local communities to develop policies and initiatives that promote equal rights, expand opportunities, and ensure protection from discrimination, violence, and injustice. By advocating for inclusive governance, economic empowerment, education, healthcare, and leadership opportunities, UN Women seeks to create a world where every woman and girl can realize her full potential, regardless of her background or circumstances.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (At the heart of UN Women's mission is the recognition that gender equality is not only a fundamental human right but also a cornerstone of sustainable development, peace, and global prosperity. Societies that empower women and girls benefit from stronger economies, more effective institutions, healthier communities, and greater social cohesion. Conversely, gender inequality exacerbates poverty, fuels instability, and limits the ability of nations to respond effectively to global challenges. For this reason, UN Women places gender equality at the center of efforts to achieve lasting development and resilience.)
/E (At the heart of UN Women's mission is the recognition that gender equality is not only a fundamental human right but also a cornerstone of sustainable development, peace, and global prosperity. Societies that empower women and girls benefit from stronger economies, more effective institutions, healthier communities, and greater social cohesion. Conversely, gender inequality exacerbates poverty, fuels instability, and limits the ability of nations to respond effectively to global challenges. For this reason, UN Women places gender equality at the center of efforts to achieve lasting development and resilience.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
