/Title (UN Women is the United Nations entity dedicated to advancing gender equality and the empowerment of women and girls worldwide. Established to champion the rights of women and girls in every sphere of society, UN Women works closely with Member States, civil society organizations, international partners, and local communities to develop policies and initiatives that promote equal rights, expand opportunities, and ensure protection from discrimination, violence, and injustice. By advocating for inclusive governance, economic empowerment, education, healthcare, and leadership opportunities, UN Women seeks to create a world where every woman and girl can realize her full potential, regardless of her background or circumstances.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 960 0 R
/Next 1055 0 R
>>
