1077 0 obj
<<
/Title (Delegates are therefore invited to examine how governments, international organizations, and local stakeholders can integrate gender perspectives into policymaking to strengthen national and global resilience. Discussions may focus on improving women's participation in peacebuilding and conflict resolution, promoting equal access to education and economic opportunities, addressing gender-based violence during humanitarian crises, closing digital divides in an era of technological advancement, and ensuring that climate adaptation and disaster response strategies are inclusive and equitable.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 960 0 R
/Prev 1071 0 R
/Next 1072 0 R
>>
endobj
